# Same-origin on purpose — see the `proxy` block in vite.config.ts.
#
# A relative base means the browser never makes a cross-site request, so the API's
# SameSite=Lax session cookies are treated as first-party and are actually sent. Pointing
# this at https://api.maliroperations.com/api/v1 directly makes login return 200 and then
# leaves every following request anonymous, which presents as a screen that loads forever.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
